Package: amber-webkit-dev
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Andre Bremer <hyperquader@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: amber-webkit (= @VERSION@), amber-gtk4-dev (>= @GTK_MIN@), libsoup-3.0-dev, libglib2.0-dev
Section: libdevel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Hyperquader-Coders/amber-webkit
Description: WebKitGTK development files for the amber suite's bundle
 The headers, pkg-config files and unversioned library links of the
 amber-webkit bundle, all under /usr/lib/amber-webkit, so they never
 meet the distro's libwebkitgtk-6.0-dev. The suite's Odin binding is
 generated from these headers.
 .
 Build with PKG_CONFIG_PATH set to
 /usr/lib/amber-webkit/pkgconfig:/usr/lib/amber-gtk4/pkgconfig, and give the
 program the RUNPATH /usr/lib/amber-webkit:/usr/lib/amber-gtk4.
